Package: Rucksack
Type: Package
Title: Carry R and RStudio Settings Between Computers
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Zadra",
    email = "jzadra@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates portable compressed backups of user-level R and RStudio
    configuration and restores them using paths discovered on the destination
    computer. On Windows, the package can also carry, register, and immediately
    load per-user fonts without administrator rights, including persistent
    loading at current-user Windows startup.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jzadra/Rucksack
BugReports: https://github.com/jzadra/Rucksack/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports:
    utils
Suggests:
    BiocManager,
    remotes,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
